So let's have a mini-fest at UCB.  I'll be there
in all probability, Robin is within spitting
distance, Shoulson is proposing a talk and so
will be around for at least some of the time. 
Others from the coast or who can come more
readily to that meeting than Michigan?

The conference is now looking less like a place
to have a booth than one for a (very) short
presentation over and above what can be fitted
into a more general topic.  But Lojbaners can go
off and do their own thing -- and invite others
to join them -- outside the official sessions.


